## Goal

Allow a user to inspect the complete version history of an Area and restore
a selected historical version.

Example:

Area current state:

v1 CREATED
v2 UPDATED
v3 UPDATED
v4 DELETED
v5 RESTORED
v6 UPDATED

The user should be able to open History and see these versions in a useful
order.

For an eligible historical version, the user should be able to restore it.

Restore must use the existing Task 05 restore implementation and OCC
semantics rather than introducing a second restore mechanism.

