## Version History API

Review DESIGN.md and use the documented endpoint if one already exists.

Expected functionality is equivalent to:

GET /workspaces/{workspaceId}/areas/{areaId}/versions

Do not invent a different contract if DESIGN.md already defines one.

The endpoint should return the Area's immutable AreaVersion history.

Determine from DESIGN.md:

- response structure;
- ordering;
- whether pagination exists;
- whether currentVersion is represented specially;
- whether changedBy is exposed;
- timestamp representation;
- geometry representation;
- whether status/changeType are included.

Do not invent fields solely for UI convenience.

