## History Ordering

Propose an explicit ordering.

For the UI, newest-first is likely the most useful:

v6
v5
v4
v3
v2
v1

But follow DESIGN.md if ordering is specified there.

Ordering must be deterministic.

Do not rely on implicit database row order.

