## DELETED Areas

This needs explicit consideration.

Normal viewport queries exclude DELETED Areas.

Therefore, after a deleted Area disappears from the normal map, its history
is not normally discoverable through the map.

Task 05 already provides immediate undo.

For Task 06:

- inspect DESIGN.md;
- determine whether a general mechanism for discovering deleted Areas is
  already required;
- do not build a Deleted Areas management screen unless required.

If arbitrary history access for a DELETED Area cannot be reached naturally
from the current UI, report this as a limitation.

Do not expand scope automatically.

