## Workspace Boundary

History access must enforce Workspace ownership.

For Area X belonging to Workspace A:

GET /workspaces/B/areas/{X}/versions

must not expose:

- existence of Area X;
- its versions;
- its version numbers;
- its geometry;
- its metadata.

Use the established workspace-boundary semantics.

Do not implement user authorization yet.

