## Frontend Manual Flow

The completed Task 06 should make this scenario demonstrable:

1. Create Area "Original".
2. Edit it to "Version 2".
3. Change its geometry.
4. Edit again to "Version 3".
5. Open History.
6. See CREATED and UPDATED versions.
7. Select an older version.
8. Inspect enough information to understand that version.
9. Restore it.
10. See the Area change to the historical snapshot.
11. Open History again.
12. See a new RESTORED version at the top.
13. Refresh the browser.
14. Verify the restored state remains current.

This should be possible without database inspection.

